{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/4001ebd417c2e8e842f40a3e53c33b5b.webp?t=1761318184\" width=611 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/53fc5f5c947f321e9efb781be04a7cb1.poster.avif?t=1761318184\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/53fc5f5c947f321e9efb781be04a7cb1.webm?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/53fc5f5c947f321e9efb781be04a7cb1.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea Of Rifts is a naval roguelike RPG with a focus on procedural storytelling set in a quirky dark fantasy world inspired by the age when sailing ships were clad in iron. In the demo you get to start out on your journey as captain of one of these vessels, hire a motley crew of misfits to man it, and make it your own with various upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality has been torn apart and other dimensions are bleeding through. Explore two of these Rifts in the demo to seek fortune and fame  but beware; The Sea Of Rifts leaves a mark on all those that dare enter it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/e712df5a2a4b1ed1f5c4776f53e50fa1.webp?t=1761318184\" width=611 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/c5c6a2695413c9795366095cf9e584f8.poster.avif?t=1761318184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/c5c6a2695413c9795366095cf9e584f8.webm?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/c5c6a2695413c9795366095cf9e584f8.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the ironclad era, traverse the sea with both steam and sail. Make the ship your own with various weapons, engines, sails, and auxiliary equipment to find the playstyle that reflects who you are as a captain. Engage in naval combat against other ships as well as the monstrosities that lurk beneath the waves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/e084db61271a72cf3b0a34a4e86b5f61.webp?t=1761318184\" width=611 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/427e9fc69b99b17707fbc8e6be77d80d.poster.avif?t=1761318184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/427e9fc69b99b17707fbc8e6be77d80d.webm?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/427e9fc69b99b17707fbc8e6be77d80d.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew members are generated from many different traits that determine their capabilities and personality. Get to know them over time and do your best to manage the social interaction between them. Gain their trust to become a true crew that have each other\u2019s backs but beware of Infighting. An unhappy crew is a sure way to have a mutiny on your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/e8b52c0a0eb9feab6f67db072e0a654b.webp?t=1761318184\" width=611 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.poster.avif?t=1761318184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.webm?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will let you delve into the game\u2019s systems to tell an emergent story of your crew\u2019s journey. Experience great sorrow, dangers and triumphs to get a taste of how your journey towards The Great Rift will unfold in the full game. <br><br>The helm is yours captain.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083620?t=1761318184","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/f2fc7e93813803a6afd1e49c7be2ac0b0288fe95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761318184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/918bd492614eb8999807d1b1f1485e641dd09ea1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761318184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st