source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/427e9fc69b99b17707fbc8e6be77d80d.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew members are generated from many different traits that determine their capabilities and personality. Get to know them over time and do your best to manage the social interaction between them. Gain their trust to become a true crew that have each other\u2019s backs but beware of Infighting. An unhappy crew is a sure way to have a mutiny on your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/e8b52c0a0eb9feab6f67db072e0a654b.webp?t=1761318184\" width=611 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.poster.avif?t=1761318184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.webm?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083620/extras/6cc82ebcebb1814b33d57aa810511be0.mp4?t=1761318184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will let you delve into the game\u2019s systems to tell an emergent story of your crew\u2019s journey. Experience great sorrow, dangers and triumphs to get a taste of how your journey towards The Great Rift will unfold in the full game. <br><br>The helm is yours captain.</p>","developers":["Out Of Bounds Games ApS"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2527970","name":"Sea Of Rifts"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adve